  FORMAT OF THE SUBSETTED FILE
    
    ITEMS                      FORMAT   
     
 1 YEAR                          I4        
 2 DOY                           I4        
 3 Hour                          I3        
 4 Scalar B, nT                  F6.1      
 5 SW Proton Density, N/cm^3     F6.1      
 6 Kp index                      I3        
 7 Dst-index, nT                 I6        
 8 f10.7_index                   F6.1      
